    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5159" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμέργω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ξω</span> (v. infr.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pluck</i> or <i>pull,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθε᾽ ἀμέργοισαν παῖδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					121
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πετάλων ἄπο . . χερὶ καρπὸν ἀμέρξων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					397
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.882
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὰς ἐλάας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					437
				</span></i>
			 (<i>squeeze out</i> juice, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				318.11
			</span></i>):—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμερξάμεναι . . δρυὸς ἄγρια φύλλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					26.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1144
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				864
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
